    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is an atmospheric early development stage single-player first-person game.</i> <br>You find yourself on a remote island where you must survive and grow plants. Explore the wild nature, build primitive infrastructure, tend to your crops, interact with the environment, manage time through sleep, and try to keep your sanity in complete isolation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rush \u2014 the story doesn\u2019t push you forward. You choose how to live each day.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is an atmospheric early development stage single-player first-person game.</i> <br>You find yourself on a remote island where you must survive and grow plants. Explore the wild nature, build primitive infrastructure, tend to your crops, interact with the environment, manage time through sleep, and try to keep your sanity in complete isolation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rush \u2014 the story doesn\u2019t push you forward. You choose how to live each day.</p>",
